WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:04.036
-The investigation
of President Trump's campaign

00:00:04.036 --> 00:00:06.605
seems to be homing in
on several key figures

00:00:06.605 --> 00:00:08.875
while also widening
to include more countries.

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:11.878
Meanwhile, Trump is spinning
a wild conspiracy theory

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:13.479
about the FBI spying on him.

00:00:13.479 --> 00:00:16.115
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:16.115 --> 00:00:18.117 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:20.819 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.819 --> 00:00:22.922
-The president was holed up
in the White House

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:24.724
over the weekend
with no public events

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:26.326
while The New York Times
and other outlets

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:28.327
published one new bombshell
after another

00:00:28.327 --> 00:00:30.330
about his campaign's ties
to foreign governments.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:33.432
So naturally, Trump got up
bright and early Sunday morning

00:00:33.432 --> 00:00:35.234
and unfurled one of his longest

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:37.236
and most incoherent
Twitter rants yet.

00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:39.038
In fact, it would take too long

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:40.840
to have someone read
the whole thing for you.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:43.810
So, as it goes, we're just gonna
have to speed it up.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:44.844
Here it is.

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:53.286
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.957 --> 00:00:59.993
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:08.568
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:15.375
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:20.280
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.683 --> 00:01:27.753
-And don't worry about
not being able to follow that.

00:01:27.753 --> 00:01:30.390
It actually makes less sense
at normal speed.

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:31.624
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:33.059
By the way, Twitter,
did I ever thank you

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:34.593
for raising the character limit?

00:01:34.593 --> 00:01:37.663
I didn't? Good.

00:01:37.663 --> 00:01:39.299
Also, it's not fair
that a president

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:41.100
who won't read a two-page
press briefing

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:43.970
makes us read a six-part
Twitter rant.

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:46.306
This rant is so long,
it technically qualifies

00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:48.140
as a miniseries.

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:50.910
Look for it streaming
this summer on Net-dicks.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.912
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:53.980
Now...

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.448
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:58.517
...Trump is, in his usual way,

00:01:58.517 --> 00:02:00.786
conflating and lying
about a whole bunch of issues.

00:02:00.786 --> 00:02:03.388
And one of them is a story
published over the weekend

00:02:03.388 --> 00:02:04.657
about his son, Don Jr.

00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:06.826
Now, we already knew Don Jr.

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:08.328
held that infamous
Trump Tower meeting

00:02:08.328 --> 00:02:09.895
where he met with Russians,

00:02:09.895 --> 00:02:13.099
offering dirt on Hillary Clinton
during the 2016 campaign.

00:02:13.099 --> 00:02:15.467
But what we found out
over the weekend

00:02:15.467 --> 00:02:17.369
was that it wasn't just Russia.

00:02:17.369 --> 00:02:18.538
The New York Times reports

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:20.440
that Don Jr. also met secretly
with...

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:28.648
Now, this story is crazy
for a variety of reasons.

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:30.183
For one thing,
it was arranged by...

00:02:34.153 --> 00:02:37.890
So, Saudi Princes, Don Jr.,
and the Blackwater guy.

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:39.459
The only people missing
from that meeting

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:41.527
were Dr. Strangelove
and Monty Burns.

00:02:41.527 --> 00:02:43.062
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:44.297
Now, Prince was interviewed

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:45.998
by the House Intelligence
Committee last year

00:02:45.998 --> 00:02:47.333
as part of their investigation.

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:49.502
And in his sworn testimony,
it really seems

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:50.570
like he straight up-lied

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:52.071
about his role
in the Trump campaign,

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:53.873
claiming he was just
a casual supporter.

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:11.824
Ugh.

00:03:11.824 --> 00:03:12.858
Just when you think you know

00:03:12.858 --> 00:03:14.827
every evil thing
about Erik Prince,

00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:18.131
you find out
he's a yard-sign guy.

00:03:18.131 --> 00:03:19.498
What did the yard sign say?

00:03:19.498 --> 00:03:21.000
"Looking for a secret meeting?

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:25.171
Interested in world domination?
Call Erik Prince at 1-800-EVIL."

00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:27.306
Now, let's just step back here
and consider

00:03:27.306 --> 00:03:30.375
how many times Trump aides have
lied or contradicted themselves

00:03:30.375 --> 00:03:32.144
in official testimony.

00:03:32.144 --> 00:03:33.279
When it comes to meetings

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:34.647
with foreign governments
during the campaign,

00:03:34.647 --> 00:03:36.882
just last week, the Senate
Judiciary Committee released

00:03:36.882 --> 00:03:38.518
transcripts of its meeting
with Don Jr.

00:03:38.518 --> 00:03:40.719
And here's one portion
of that testimony

00:03:40.719 --> 00:03:42.354
where he changed his story
multiple times

00:03:42.354 --> 00:03:43.456
in just a few sentences.

00:04:07.213 --> 00:04:08.347
"I didn't know about it.

00:04:08.347 --> 00:04:09.748
I knew about it after the fact.

00:04:09.748 --> 00:04:11.250
I knew about it
when it happened."

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:14.387
Man, Trump nailed it
when he named this one.

00:04:14.387 --> 00:04:15.721
[ Laughter ]

00:04:15.721 --> 00:04:16.923
[ As Trump ]
He looks like someone

00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:18.358
who can't keep
his stories straight.

00:04:18.358 --> 00:04:21.427
Let's also call him Donald.

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:22.995
[ Normal voice ] And then --

00:04:22.995 --> 00:04:24.463
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:24.463 --> 00:04:27.733
Then there's the fact

00:04:27.733 --> 00:04:29.802
that the official story
from the Trump camp

00:04:29.802 --> 00:04:32.505
has always been
that Trump himself was unaware

00:04:32.505 --> 00:04:33.806
of the meeting
with the Russians.

00:04:33.806 --> 00:04:36.643
But then last week,
Trump's lawyer, Rudy Giuliani,

00:04:36.643 --> 00:04:38.944
seemed to admit that he might
have been aware at the time

00:04:38.944 --> 00:04:40.179
and just forgot about it.

00:04:40.179 --> 00:04:41.214
Giuliani said...

00:04:52.658 --> 00:04:54.960
What a comfort it must be

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:57.730
to have Rudy Giuliani
in your corner.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:58.898
"Don't worry, boss.

00:04:58.898 --> 00:05:00.499
I told them
that maybe you knew about it,

00:05:00.499 --> 00:05:01.968
but you're too stupid
to remember.

00:05:01.968 --> 00:05:03.636
You're welcome!"

00:05:03.636 --> 00:05:05.771
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:05.771 --> 00:05:09.675
Now...the other --

00:05:09.675 --> 00:05:11.744
The other crazy part
of this latest story

00:05:11.744 --> 00:05:13.345
about Don Jr.'s meeting
with Gulf states

00:05:13.345 --> 00:05:16.014
is who else was in his office
when the group met.

00:05:16.014 --> 00:05:17.650
Until now, there have been
a few Trump aides

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:18.818
who have managed
to keep their names

00:05:18.818 --> 00:05:21.087
out of the special counsel's
investigation.

00:05:21.087 --> 00:05:22.388
But The New York Times reports
that...

00:05:28.628 --> 00:05:31.631
Ah, yes, top campaign aide
Stephen Miller.

00:05:31.631 --> 00:05:33.633
[ Thunder cracks ]

00:05:33.633 --> 00:05:35.668
[ Laughter ]

00:05:41.673 --> 00:05:44.510
Although Miller wasn't actually
in the office for the meeting,

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:47.612
he was right outside in his
usual spot on the ledge.

00:05:47.612 --> 00:05:50.016
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:50.016 --> 00:05:55.220
So with Special Counsel
Robert Mueller's investigators

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:57.122
closing in on several
key Trump allies

00:05:57.122 --> 00:05:58.457
and finding out more

00:05:58.457 --> 00:06:00.293
about his campaign's ties
to other foreign governments,

00:06:00.293 --> 00:06:02.962
Trump and his team
are doing everything they can

00:06:02.962 --> 00:06:04.430
to obstruct the investigation.

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:07.600
And now Trump is spinning
a wild new conspiracy theory

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:11.136
about the FBI implanting
a spy in the Trump campaign,

00:06:11.136 --> 00:06:12.604
and he wants the government
to look into it.

00:06:12.604 --> 00:06:13.639
Trump tweeted on Sunday...

00:06:22.181 --> 00:06:24.416
Well, I've heard Donald Trump
say a lot of things,

00:06:24.416 --> 00:06:28.087
but I never thought one of those
things would be "hereby."

00:06:28.087 --> 00:06:30.056
[ As Trump ] I hereby demand
an investigation,

00:06:30.056 --> 00:06:32.892
albeit heretofore, unheard of,
nonetheless,

00:06:32.892 --> 00:06:35.527
I demand one forthwith.

00:06:35.527 --> 00:06:36.662
[ Normal voice ]
Now, the FBI

00:06:36.662 --> 00:06:38.130
did have an informant
working with them,

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:39.231
but that's not a spy.

00:06:39.231 --> 00:06:40.366
I mean, seriously.

00:06:40.366 --> 00:06:41.934
You think they needed a spy

00:06:41.934 --> 00:06:44.403
to catch you colluding
with Russia?

00:06:44.403 --> 00:06:46.004
All they needed
was a microphone.

00:06:46.004 --> 00:06:49.575
You literally looked
into the camera on TV and said,

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:51.310
"Russia, if you're listening."

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:52.978
[ Laughter ]

00:06:52.978 --> 00:06:54.447
That's like
coming out of the bathroom

00:06:54.447 --> 00:06:56.482
with white powder
under your nose and saying,

00:06:56.482 --> 00:07:00.786
"I am ready to party because
I just did cocaine."

00:07:00.786 --> 00:07:02.121
This has been "A Closer Look."

00:07:02.121 --> 00:07:03.889 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:03.889 --> 00:07:05.691 line:0%
♪♪

